# The market house in the evening (reports/render-features/2026-11-15-night-interiors): its shutters and plinth
# openings glow and the lamps of its shop and inn burn, all before the shop's bedtime (23:00). Four views: the whole
# front from the square, the plinth's openings close, the shop from its front wall, the inn's floor above it.
# The price of the glow and of the houses is the difference between a content with the house's records and masks
# and one without them (PERF_ENV='OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set>').
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 22 5
cadence normal
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
cam look -1240
goto pos 9137 2000 3745
cam world 1650 -1560 24.462
# Ten real seconds after the teleport for loading and native simulation.
wait 10000
cam hold
perf sample perf-house-night/view-1
wait 8000
perf stop
cam look -540
goto pos 8970 940 4008
cam world 397.271 -500 25.016893
wait 3000
cam hold
perf sample perf-house-night/view-2
wait 8000
perf stop
cam look -1530
goto pos 8632.5 2000 3405.2
cam world 380 -1497 24.462
wait 3000
cam hold
perf sample perf-house-night/view-3
wait 8000
perf stop
cam look -1300
goto pos 8785.7 2000 3310.2
cam world 300 -1260 204.462
wait 3000
cam hold
perf sample perf-house-night/view-4
wait 8000
perf stop
